THOUGHT: I need to create the debounce function implementation first. Let me start by creating the t10_debounce.js file with the basic debounce function.
ACTION: write_file
PATH: t10_debounce.js
```javascript
function debounce(fn, ms) {
  let timeoutId;
  return function (...args) {
    clearTimeout(timeoutId);
    timeoutId = setTimeout(() => fn.apply(this, args), ms);
  };
}

module.exports = { debounce };
```

